From 78e417a5e9563e5e5341a3273fa1b0008c346a78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: johnmart19 <johnivan19999@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:02:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] alioth: Add final recovery hardware, safety and ramdisk
 integration

Implement timed AW8697 feedback, 120 Hz display and GUI pacing, supported-partition menus, bundled Magisk fallback, current/image active-slot ramdisk installation and corrected labels/device display. Preserve upstream recovery backports separately.

Co-authored-by: codex <noreply@openai.com>
